Description: A television client for Jellyfin.
 Plays the films and television shows on a Jellyfin server, on a
 television, from a sofa. Video is decoded by libmpv rather than in a
 browser, so audio passthrough, hardware decoding and formats a browser
 will not touch all play without the server transcoding them.
